<title>RUSSIA: Lukoil Jan-Sept net profit 2.61 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Lukoil Jan-Sept net profit 2.61 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended Sept 30</p>
<p>						1996	     1995</p>
<p>    Net profit (billion roubles)   2,609	     +118 pct</p>
<p>    Consolidated sales		32,557	     +137 pct</p>
<p>    Net profit (million dollars)     522		n/a</p>
<p>    Consolidated sales		 6,511	     +116 pct</p>
<p>    Crude output (million tonnes)   43.6	     42.9</p>
<p>    Refined oil			   14.4	     same</p>
<p>    Crude output (thousand bpd)    1,178.2	  1,163.4</p>
<p>NOTES - Full name OAO Neftyanaya Kompaniya LUKoil.</p>
<p>Comparisons for profit and sales show percentage change over 1995 period for 1996. Company said exports of crude in first nine months were 19.3 percent or 2.7 million tonnes higher than year-ago period. Exports of oil products rose 71.3 percent or 1.3 million tonnes higher. Crude includes gas condensate.</p>
<p>Figures are to Russian accounting standards on accruals basis.</p>
<p>--Jonathan Lynn, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
